{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of mayor in a gnome settlement in this roguelike deckbuilder. Use cards to grow the sacred tree, construct buildings, and gather resources to defend your people from monsters &amp; disasters. Choose your mayor, each with a unique card and skills, to lead the kingdom and restore its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/75340a903309f25542f736f4c9a93ee8.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the deepest roots to the highest bloom, you are the builder of your tree kingdom. Grow its roots and trunk, add leaves and flowers, and even construct structures in it. Customize your kingdom above, below, and within the tree itself, making a great kingdom that shows off your strategy and vision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/c437a02b14343f2a61eeb93d11287aa3.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your deck with new cards from a visiting trader, but make sure you've saved up enough gems. They offer unique sets to help you conquer future challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/1f4c11f25b4251cdba6436f2d575197d.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp, though - disasters and bad weather will threaten your kingdom. Oh, and did we mention monsters? You\u2019d better watch out for those, too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/9c6224d2b1cd262660aa1f3855458803.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete altars to appeal to the angels, who will bestow blessings upon your kingdom. Their gifts will aid you in completing your quests. Each passing season brings a new chance to appeal to another angel, waiting to bless you with a new boon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay</strong>: A turn-based deckbuilder, roguelike, city-builder, and tower defense game in one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ engaging cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random events &amp; festivals</strong> \u2014 some bring fortune, others... not so much.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 distinct angels,</strong> each offering their own unique boon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Battle, Bless: A kingdom of charm and chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=478 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938990?t=1768568930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938990?t=1768568930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/2ffc58780cf9e676a9e5be3f258306659635ee16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768568930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/2ffc58780cf9e676a9e5be3f258306659635ee16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768568930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/51984ecf813738068bf255f7ffdc30a6.avif?t=1768568930\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras_big/51984ecf813738068bf255f7ffdc30a6.webp?t=1768568930 width=1560 height=548 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of mayor in a gnome settlement in this roguelike deckbuilder. Use cards to grow the sacred tree, construct buildings, and gather resources to defend your people from monsters &amp; disasters. Choose your mayor, each with a unique card and skills, to lead the kingdom and restore its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/75340a903309f25542f736f4c9a93ee8.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the deepest roots to the highest bloom, you are the builder of your tree kingdom. Grow its roots and trunk, add leaves and flowers, and even construct structures in it. Customize your kingdom above, below, and within the tree itself, making a great kingdom that shows off your strategy and vision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/c437a02b14343f2a61eeb93d11287aa3.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your deck with new cards from a visiting trader, but make sure you've saved up enough gems. They offer unique sets to help you conquer future challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/1f4c11f25b4251cdba6436f2d575197d.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.poster.avif?t=1768568930\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.webm?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.mp4?t=1768568930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp, though - disasters and bad weather will threaten your kingdom. Oh, and did we mention monsters? You\u2019d better watch out for those, too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/9c6224d2b1cd262660aa1f3855458803.avif?t=1768568930\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cente